(1)   94/     2A2 :                     ;
(1)   95/     2A2 :                     ; Note:
(1)   96/     2A2 :                     ; UNUSED instruments MUST use gInsNull or
(1)   97/     2A2 :                     ; the Z80 gets unexpected results and probably crash.
