(1)  440/     504 :                     ; d1.b | Playback slot number
(1)  441/     504 :                     ;        If -1: Set to all slots
(1)  442/     504 :                     ;
(1)  443/     504 :                     ; Notes:
(1)  444/     504 :                     ; - DO NOT MIX THIS WITH gemaFadeSeq
(1)  445/     504 :                     ; - v1.0: This only works on (re)start
