(1)  880/     B1A :                     ;
(1)  881/     B1A :                     ; Notes:
(1)  882/     B1A :                     ; - For a faster load, call this during VBlank or
(1)  883/     B1A :                     ;   disable VDP Display temporally.
(1)  884/     B1A :                     ;
