(1)  248/    174A :                     ; --------------------------------------------------------
(1)  249/    174A :                     ; System_Render
(1)  250/    174A :                     ;
(1)  251/    174A :                     ; This will:
(1)  252/    174A :                     ; - Drop a frame if we got late on VBlank
(1)  253/    174A :                     ; - Process Palette fading buffers
(1)  254/    174A :                     ;   (Video_MdMars_RunFade: CPU-INTENSIVE IF PROCESSING
(1)  255/    174A :                     ;   BOTH VDP AND 32X SVDP Palettes)
(1)  256/    174A :                     ; - Check the sound driver for any changes/requests
(1)  257/    174A :                     ;   from Z80 (Sound_Update, several times)
(1)  258/    174A :                     ; - 32X/CD32X only: Update the "DREQ RAM" section
(1)  259/    174A :                     ;   to the SH2 using DREQ FIFO (System_MdMars_Update)
(1)  260/    174A :                     ;
(1)  261/    174A :                     ; Then during VBlank:
(1)  262/    174A :                     ; - Read the Input data (System_Input)
(1)  263/    174A :                     ; - Transfer the VDP Palette, Sprites and Scroll
(1)  264/    174A :                     ;   from from RAM to VDP and process the DMA BLAST list.
(1)  265/    174A :                     ;   (Video_Render)
(1)  266/    174A :                     ;
(1)  267/    174A :                     ; Notes:
(1)  268/    174A :                     ; - This exits INSIDE VBlank
(1)  269/    174A :                     ; - If VDP Display is disabled all of this
(1)  270/    174A :                     ;   will be skipped.
(1)  271/    174A :                     ; --------------------------------------------------------
